--- !u!114 &1597052101
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1597052096}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d4802fd00ef24253a33cda08e02307c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - So... another one crosses the river.
  - You wear the robes of a sorcerer. Dangerous clothing, these days.
  - 'They feared you, didn''t they? '
  - Called you cursed, evil, unnatural. And for that... they cast you out.
  - Banished. Stripped of name and home. Thrown into Limbo, the waiting room of the
    dead.
  - "But crossing the River of Life comes with a price\u2014your soul."
  - The Queen holds it now, deep in her twisted castle.
  - Without it, you're a hollow echo of what you once were.
  - Yet, you're not entirely empty. The good Doctor patched you up with some borrowed
    souls.
  - "It won\u2019t last long, but it works for a temporary fix."
  - You want your power back? Your true life? Then retrieve your soul.
  - "The Doctor waits at the far edge of this forsaken town. But first... there\u2019s
    a husk tearing apart the tall-roofed house nearby."
  - It was a sorcerer once, like you, but now just a shell. Defeat it. Prove your
    will still burns.
  - The second floor holds a reward for you.
  - Now go, Sorcerer, go reclaim your soul.
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1640515275}
  typingSpeed: 0.05
